{title: Jeena Yahan Marna Yahan}
{artist: Mukesh}
{key: F}

{c: Verse 1}
[Fm]Jeena yahan[C]marna yahan,        [C]Iske siwa[Fm]jaana kahan?
[Fm]Jeena yahan[C]marna yahan,        [C]Iske siwa[Fm]jaana kahan
[Fm]Jee chahe jab humko awaaz do,        [Eb]Hum hain wahin,[C]hum they ja[Fm]han.
[Fm]Apne yahin[C]dono jahan,        [C]Iske siwa[Fm]jana kahan

{c: Verse 1}
[F]Yeh mera geet,[Bb]jeevan sangeet,        [A#m]Kal bhi koi[Fm]dohraayega.
[F]Yeh mera geet,[Bb]jeevan sangeet,        [A#m]Kal bhi koi[Fm]dohraayega.
[F]Jag ko hasaane[Bb]behroopiya,        [A#m]Roop badal phir[Fm]aayega!
[Fm]Swarg yahin,[C]Nark yahan ?        [C]Iske siwa[Fm]jaana kahan
[Fm]Jee chahe jab humko awaaz do,        [Eb]Hum hain wahin,[C]hum they ja[Fm]han.
[Fm]Apne yahin[C]dono jahan,        [C]Iske siwa[Fm]jana kahan?

{c: Verse 1}
[F]Kal khel mein[Bb]hum ho na ho        [A#m]Gardish mein taare[Fm]rahenge sada.
[F]Kal khel mein[Bb]hum ho na ho        [A#m]Gardish mein taare[Fm]rahenge sada.
[F]Bhoologey tum,[Bb]bhoolengey woh,        [A#m]Par hum tumhare[Fm]rahenge sada.
[Fm]Rahenge yahin[C]apne nishaan ?        [C]Iske siwa[Fm]jaana kahan
[Fm]Jee chahe jab humko awaaz do,        [Eb]Hum hain wahin,[C]hum they ja[Fm]han.
[Fm]Apne yahin[C]dono jahan,        [C]Iske siwa[Fm]jana kahan
[Fm]Jeena yahan[C]marna yahan,        [C]Iske siwa[Fm]jaana kahan

